<title>GERMANY: German Linde acquires US-based TPQ.</title>
<headline>German Linde acquires US-based TPQ.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>German engineering group Linde AG said on Monday it had acquired the United States engineering company The Pro-Quip Corp (TPQ), at Tulsa, Oklahoma-based group with 1996 sales of $65 million.</p>
<p>Linde said TPQ's customer base comprised major international gas companies, refineries and the chemical and petro-chemical industries.</p>
<p>It gave no price details in its statement.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
